ul.li:
              Remarks lines 2-4 : Use these lines to enter the input details for the Allocations (M175) , Additional Data (M107) , and Renewal/Revised (M106) transaction. Include instructions to:


rescind the stop pay if one has been imposed;

move no more than the dividend amount to the EIB1 PSCD account;

advise the adjudicating officer of the OP amount;

send the draft ACS letter;

Create additional operational centre memos if necessary.
